# Swoosh: SELECT held on the Space page. Off in every recipe; with the piece; gone with the recipe. A project from the
# bells' colours' build (format 10) keeps its settings, Swoosh off.
wait 300
tap FX
wait 100
expect view 6
expect par54 0
press SEL
wait 100
shot off.png
spin K1 4
expect par54 4
spin K2 -6
expect par55 44
spin K3 2
expect par56 32
spin K4 3
expect par57 53
wait 100
shot on.png
release SEL
wait 100
expect view 6
tap SAVE
wait 200
reboot
wait 300
expect par54 4
expect par55 44
expect par56 32
expect par57 53
press SAVE
wait 1700
release SAVE
wait 100
expect par54 0
expect par55 50
expect par56 30
expect par57 50
storev10 13
reboot
wait 300
expect par0 13
expect par54 0
expect par55 50
expect par56 30
expect par57 50
tap SAVE
wait 200
reboot
wait 300
expect par0 13
expect par54 0
